# Source brand art, kept out of git on purpose. These are the originals the
# shipped assets under public/brand/ were derived from, not files the site
# serves. Committing one writes a large source image into history permanently
# (a later git rm does not remove it), and referencing one from the app would
# ship a source-quality file to a customer instead of the optimised asset.
# Matched by exact path so the rest of public/brand/, the real assets, is
# never blocked. Both public/brand/ and the old /public/ root are listed for
# each file: the files live in public/brand/ today, but the previous version
# of this block only matched /public/ and silently stopped covering anything
# when they moved -- keeping both is deliberate margin against the next move,
# not dead weight.
/public/Kens mobile tire logo.jpg
/public/brand/Kens mobile tire logo.jpg
/public/icm_fullxfull.681608358_isz0wre9asgk00wkwsgo.jpg
/public/brand/icm_fullxfull.681608358_isz0wre9asgk00wkwsgo.jpg
/public/icm_fullxfull.685139857_m8dvmt2fkxwgo8gs4448.jpg
/public/brand/icm_fullxfull.685139857_m8dvmt2fkxwgo8gs4448.jpg

# Uncommitted originals a delivery dropped straight into public/brand/, not
# ours to publish -- not derived assets, not sourced from the three above.
# Same rule as the block above: never referenced by filename, never
# committed.
/public/brand/IMG_0068.jpg
/public/brand/IMG_0074.jpg
/public/brand/IMG_0092.jpg
/public/brand/IMG_7943.PNG
